    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d364">

                <pb facs="0505" n="425" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg425"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Shah of Persia to President Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-09-20"><hi rendition="#italic">September 20,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>On the occasion of the accession of your excellency to the Presidency I sincerely
                    congratulate you, and express the best wishes that I make for your happiness and
                    the prosperity of the United States.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mozaffer ed Dine</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
